# Environment template for the nl-to-sql-agent kit.
#
# The canonical template lives at apps/.env.example and is used by the Next.js
# app (create .env.local from it inside apps/). This file exists so the kit
# advertises its env requirements at the kit root:
#
#   cp apps/.env.example apps/.env.local
#
# Required settings: LAMATIC_API_URL, LAMATIC_PROJECT_ID, LAMATIC_API_KEY,
# NL_TO_SQL_FLOW_ID, SESSION_PASSWORD, DEMO_AUTH_ENABLED (+ DEMO_USERNAME /
# DEMO_PASSWORD when enabled). See apps/.env.example for descriptions.